<title>ESTONIA: EVEA PANK Q1 PROFIT 3.3 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>EVEA PANK Q1 PROFIT 3.3 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<text>
<p>TALLINN, April 4, EVEA Pank, Estonia's seventh largest bank, said on Friday that its first quarter profit was 3.3 million kroons and its March profit was 1.32 million kroons.</p>
<p>The bank's assets grew by 40.4 million kroons or 9.2 percent to 482.4 million kroons.</p>
<p>Deposits grew by 16.8 million kroons or five percent to 359 million kroons.</p>
<p>The loan portfolio grew by 8.8 million kroons or four percent to 230.9 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
